# LF everywhere: the repo is edited from Fedora and Windows against one
# working tree, and tools on the NTFS mount intermittently rewrite files
# as CRLF. Normalising at the git boundary stops those flips reaching
# commits regardless of which side staged them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never converted.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
# Bundled Inno Setup language files: keep each file's exact bytes so an
# eol/charset normalisation pass cannot corrupt them on checkout. Each is
# BOM-less UTF-8 with CRLF line endings (Vietnamese.isl declares
# LanguageCodePage=1258 in its header while its bytes are UTF-8).
*.isl binary
